description:
@kahfeveryday  ni brand dah cantek & kuat dah kat Malaysia ni. Tapi admin Kahf buat hal pulak. Susah payah bina brand, jatuh dalam masa sesaat. Rakyat Malaysia ni kalau mai bab boikot depa bersungguh oii 😅

Lain kali jangan kacau sensitiviti negara orang. Kalah bola ka, menang bola ka. Raikan jer. Takperlu buat troll or edit poster bagai.

Brand besar pun kadang-kadang boleh buat benda bodoh naaa.

@kahfeveryday Please be advised that, given the nature of the comments originating from your home country, many Malaysians believe it would be more appropriate for your business to return to Indonesia.

We do not consider the apology provided to be sufficient and also concerned that your company’s continued presence in Malaysia, may further contribute to tensions and create the impression that the matter is not being addressed with appropriate seriousness. 

Kindly GTFO from Malaysia!!

